   "source": [
    "# u-Segment3D 学习笔记 04：Indirect 方法与结果验证\n",
    "\n",
    "本笔记介绍在只有 2D 实例 mask 时如何使用 Indirect 方法完成 3D 聚合，并给出验证指标与可视化的建议。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Indirect 聚合接口\n",
    "`segment3D/usegment3d.py` 中提供了：\n",
    "```python\n",
    "aggregate_2D_to_3D_segmentation_indirect_method(\n",
    "    instances, params,\n",
    "    voxel_size_um=None,\n",
    "    psf_params=None,\n",
    "    return_debug_data=False\n",
    ")\n",
    "```\n",
    "输入 `instances` 结构与 Direct 方法类似，同样按视角组织。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "from segment3D.parameters import get_2D_to_3D_aggregation_params\n",
    "from segment3D.usegment3d import aggregate_2D_to_3D_segmentation_indirect_method\n",
    "\n",
    "shape = (32, 64, 64)\n",
    "# 构造简单的实例标签，假设同一视角已有 3 个实例\n",
    "instances = []\n",
    "for _ in range(3):\n",
    "    mask = np.zeros(shape, dtype=np.uint16)\n",
    "    mask[8:20, 10:30, 10:30] = 1\n",
    "    mask[12:24, 30:50, 35:55] = 2\n",
    "    mask[16:28, 20:40, 5:25] = 3\n",
    "    instances.append(mask)\n",
    "\n",
    "params = get_2D_to_3D_aggregation_params(method='indirect')\n",
    "labels_3d = aggregate_2D_to_3D_segmentation_indirect_method(\n",
    "    instances=instances,\n",
    "    params=params,\n",
    "    voxel_size_um=(0.5, 0.3, 0.3)\n",
    ")\n",
    "np.unique(labels_3d)
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 结果验证建议\n",
    "1. **定量指标**：若有人工标注，可使用 Dice、IoU、AJI 等指标评估。仓库的 `tutorials/evaluation/` 提供示例脚本。\n",
    "2. **可视化**：将 3D label 保存为 `.tif` 或 `.nii.gz`，在 napari/Fiji 中检查分割质量。\n",
    "3. **断层复查**：沿三个轴向逐层查看，确认重建的连续性与实例分离情况。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 复现流程建议总结\n",
    "- 按前几份笔记完成环境搭建与参数熟悉后，优先使用教程脚本在示例数据上跑通 Direct / Indirect。\n",
    "- 逐步替换为自己的 2D 预测结果，观察参数对输出的影响。\n",
    "- 最终将脚本集成到批处理流程中，实现自动化 3D 聚合。\n"
   ]
  }
